Spec: Course view

Purpose:
  A classic calendar layout in which each row is one week and each column is a weekday.

Owns:
  ./course_view.py

Must:
  Each row is one calendar week and columns are days of the week.
  Lessons and holidays are shown on their day cell.
  For the admin, clicking a day cell opens the dialog specified in ./day-dialog.sdd.

Depends on:
  ./models.sdd
  ./day-dialog.sdd

Tasks:
  [?] Decide whether the view shows one selected course, all courses, or a date range, and how the user navigates
  [ ] Implement the weekly grid
